  "content": "<h1>Cobblemon 阿爾法版</h1><div>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-alpha-project\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon-alpha-project\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<img alt=\"architectury-api\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/architectury-api_vector.svg\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Cudzer/cobblemonalphas\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img alt=\"git\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/git_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Cudzer/cobblemonalphas/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img alt=\"ghpages\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/ghpages_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<h3>專為 Cobblemon 1.7.3 打造的完整數據驅動阿爾法寶可夢生態系統</h3>\n\n\nCobblemon 阿爾法版透過稀有強大的阿爾法寶可夢、\n動態群體行為、可配置生成機制及完整數據包支援，\n擴展了 Cobblemon 的野生世界。\n\n\n</div><br><h3>本模組新增內容</h3><ul>\n<li>具備強化能力與特殊行為的稀有阿爾法寶可夢</li>\n<li>透過數據包實現物種專屬生成機制</li>\n<li>可選的色違與隱藏特性增強設定</li>\n<li>支援地底阿爾法寶可夢生成</li>\n<li>兼容 Fabric 與 NeoForge 框架</li>\n</ul><h2>功能特色</h2><h3>阿爾法寶可夢</h3><ul>\n<li>野外生成的阿爾法寶可夢，體型縮放可自訂調整</li>\n<li>提升個體值並可選配隱藏特性</li>\n<li>教學招式精通系統</li>\n<li>可選的色違出現率提升設定</li>\n<li>完全由數據包驅動的物種定義系統</li>\n</ul><h3>群體系統</h3><strong>跟隨行為</strong><br><strong>戰鬥反應</strong><br><strong>重新集結</strong><br><strong>持久連結</strong><br>",
